<http://data.silknow.org/object/fc7a30df-7ead-3475-af35-a6b391a33ea1>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cover of embroidered off-white tabby-woven cotton with silk in shades of orange, magenta, blue, green, beige and cream in chain stitch with a little laid and couched work. The ground is covered with thin scrolling stems enclosing flowers. The border, which run round all four sides, contains floral motifs within medallions. Lined with a printed cotton, and red and cream strips patterned with floral motifs and continuous wavy lines."@en , "Suzani (hanging or cover), cotton embroidered with silk in floral design, probably Bokhara, Uzbekistan, 19th century; Textiles; Embroidery"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/5275f0d3-daa5-3474-a5f2-398c09005f03> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/72cb6bb9-1bef-3558-810f-a07562f9476a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/0c0c9876-f0fe-33e1-b720-24ae195e8b93> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c3430c9f-8f19-354e-8f0a-e5b0a6e6ff1d> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Suzani (hanging or cover), cotton embroidered with silk in floral design, probably Bokhara, Uzbekistan, 19th century; Textiles; Embroidery"@en , "Cover of embroidered off-white tabby-woven cotton with silk in shades of orange, magenta, blue, green, beige and cream in chain stitch with a little laid and couched work. The ground is covered with thin scrolling stems enclosing flowers. The border, which run round all four sides, contains floral motifs within medallions. Lined with a printed cotton, and red and cream strips patterned with floral motifs and continuous wavy lines."@en ;
